              <heading>Transitional—continued effect of determinations relating to risk equalisation levy</heading>
              <content>
                <p>A determination in force immediately before the commencement of this item under <ref href="#sec-6">section 6</ref> or 7 of the <i>Private Health Insurance (Risk Equalisation Levy) Act 2003</i> has effect after that time as if it had been made in accordance with that Act as amended by this Act.</p>
                <p>[<i>Minister’s second reading speech made in—</i></p>
